invariant: INV-14
file: quic_token.c
catches: srv_quic_test
reason: the window's upper edge moves one second early, so a token checked
  exactly lifetime_seconds after it was issued is refused, where
  quic_token.h admits it. The window case requires that last valid instant
  to check and the next one to be refused.

--- old
    if (now_seconds < issued_seconds || now_seconds - issued_seconds > lifetime_seconds) {
--- new
    if (now_seconds < issued_seconds || now_seconds - issued_seconds >= lifetime_seconds) {
